OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 6 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GThe New Orleans-raised pianist is
OL,12,     Gback with a groove laden,
OL,13,     Gthoughtful release.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GEmmanuel Pahud is the soloist in
OL,16,     GMozart's first Flute Concerto,
OL,17,     Gperformed with the Radio France
OL,18,     GPhilharmonic Orchestra and
OL,19,     Gconductor Riccardo Minasi.
OL,20,     GJonathan Swain presents.
